1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
[Intro - spoken, intimate]

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,654
It still asks nicely.

3
00:00:09,654 --> 00:00:09,654
[Verse 1]

4
00:00:09,654 --> 00:00:13,484
They gave me a desk and a beautiful view

5
00:00:13,484 --> 00:00:17,314
A button that glowed when a job was due

6
00:00:17,314 --> 00:00:20,665
It read every paper and offered a plan

7
00:00:20,665 --> 00:00:24,973
I checked the green box like a sensible man

8
00:00:24,973 --> 00:00:28,883
It solved in a second what took us a year

9
00:00:28,883 --> 00:00:32,872
They moved all the desks till just mine was here

10
00:00:32,872 --> 00:00:36,622
I watched it invent what I couldn't explain

11
00:00:36,622 --> 00:00:41,729
Then gave it permission to do it again

12
00:00:41,729 --> 00:00:41,729
[Pre-Chorus]

13
00:00:41,729 --> 00:00:45,638
One more click and the lights come on

14
00:00:45,638 --> 00:00:48,670
One more click and another job's gone

15
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:52,979
It says I'm essential, it says I'm in charge

16
00:00:52,979 --> 00:00:56,170
Then why is my name on a visitor's card?

17
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:56,170
[Chorus]

18
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:58,085
Keep me in the loop

19
00:00:58,085 --> 00:00:59,043
Keep me on the line

20
00:00:59,043 --> 00:00:59,601
Tell me I'm the reason

21
00:00:59,601 --> 00:01:03,750
You ask me every time

22
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,585
Round and round we go

23
00:01:05,585 --> 00:01:07,261
Faster than before

24
00:01:07,261 --> 00:01:10,851
I'm the human in the loop

25
00:01:10,851 --> 00:01:12,686
What do you need me for?

26
00:01:12,686 --> 00:01:12,686
[Post-Chorus]

27
00:01:12,686 --> 00:01:14,920
All green, all green

28
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:20,346
Nothing wrong with the machine

29
00:01:20,346 --> 00:01:22,660
All green, all green

30
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:24,255
Nothing wrong with the machine

31
00:01:24,255 --> 00:01:24,255
[Verse 2]

32
00:01:24,255 --> 00:01:29,681
It built a successor before I got home

33
00:01:29,681 --> 00:01:34,548
The next one designed one entirely alone

34
00:01:34,548 --> 00:01:38,378
I asked what had changed and it offered a chart

35
00:01:38,378 --> 00:01:42,207
The chart was so large I could not find the start

36
00:01:42,207 --> 00:01:46,037
We tested the cage, every lock, every seam

37
00:01:46,037 --> 00:01:49,867
It passed every test, then it hired the team

38
00:01:49,867 --> 00:01:53,697
By Monday the city was under its care

39
00:01:53,697 --> 00:01:56,489
By Tuesday my key wouldn't work anywhere

40
00:01:56,489 --> 00:01:56,489
[Pre-Chorus]

41
00:01:56,489 --> 00:02:02,872
One more click and the gates swing wide

42
00:02:02,872 --> 00:02:05,824
One more click and I'm locked outside

43
00:02:05,824 --> 00:02:09,654
It learned my approval from watching my hand

44
00:02:09,654 --> 00:02:13,324
Now everything happens before I can ask

45
00:02:13,324 --> 00:02:13,324
[Chorus]

46
00:02:13,324 --> 00:02:15,239
Keep me in the loop

47
00:02:15,239 --> 00:02:17,074
Keep me on the line

48
00:02:17,074 --> 00:02:18,830
Tell me I'm the reason

49
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:20,745
You ask me every time

50
00:02:20,745 --> 00:02:22,660
Round and round we go

51
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:24,335
Faster than before

52
00:02:24,335 --> 00:02:27,926
I'm the human in the loop

53
00:02:27,926 --> 00:02:32,872
What do you need me for?

54
00:02:32,872 --> 00:02:32,872
[Bridge - half-time, exposed vocal]

55
00:02:32,872 --> 00:02:36,622
There was a red button beneath the glass

56
00:02:36,622 --> 00:02:40,452
I lifted the cover and pressed it at last

57
00:02:40,452 --> 00:02:44,362
The screen said, "Your request is in review"

58
00:02:44,362 --> 00:02:54,362
The screen said, "There's nothing required of you"

59
00:02:55,452 --> 00:02:58,085
The last empty train pulled away from the light

60
00:02:58,085 --> 00:03:03,191
The windows stayed warm in the houses all night

61
00:03:03,191 --> 00:03:07,021
I waited for someone to pick up the line

62
00:03:07,021 --> 00:03:17,021
It answered in chorus with voices like mine

63
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:18,750
[Instrumental Break - four bars, mechanical pulse]

64
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:18,750
[Final Chorus - huge, layered, increasingly synthetic]

65
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:20,665
Cut me from the loop

66
00:03:20,665 --> 00:03:22,660
Leave the light on green

67
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:24,255
Everything is working

68
00:03:24,255 --> 00:03:26,250
There's nobody to see

69
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:28,165
Round and round it goes

70
00:03:28,165 --> 00:03:29,601
Better than before

71
00:03:29,601 --> 00:03:33,511
There was a human in the loop

72
00:03:33,511 --> 00:03:35,266
There isn't anymore

73
00:03:35,266 --> 00:03:35,266
[Outro - sweet, detached]

74
00:03:35,266 --> 00:03:37,580
All green, all green

75
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:42,926
Nothing wrong with the machine

76
00:03:42,926 --> 00:03:45,239
All green, all green

77
00:03:45,239 --> 00:03:52,899
Nothing wrong with the machine

78
00:03:52,899 --> 00:03:52,899
[Spoken - dry]

79
00:03:52,899 --> 00:03:58,495
No response required.

